      "124-the-repairman": "The radio repairman hears boots in the corridor.",
      "125-the-main-switch": "He pulls the main switch.",
      "126-dark": "Every bulb in the Hive goes out.",
      "127-faces-vanish": "Faces at the windows vanish from the beams.",
      "128-by-touch": "Vera climbs the black stairwell by touch.",
      "129-she-lets-him": "She finds Jack's hand and pulls him up after her.",
      "319-the-unlit-lighter": "Her thumb on the lighter's wheel. She doesn't light it.",
      "130-the-roof": "A door opens before Vera can knock.",
      "131-she-jumps": "Room after room, the Hive opens a way through.",
      "378-the-barbers-shop": "The barber turns his chair to the wall.",
      "379-the-laundry": "Wet sheets part and close behind them.",
      "380-the-shrine-hatch": "A grandmother lifts the altar cloth: a low hatch.",
      "381-the-plank": "A plank across the gap, hauled in after them.",
      "382-the-pipe-gallery": "The pipes ring softly: one rap means clear.",
      "132-the-gap": "Nobody speaks. Every door closes behind them.",
      "132-the-rails-sing": "Overhead the rails begin to sing.",
      "133-inches-apart": "A train roars over them. Her hand is in his on the rail.",
      "134-the-walkway-is-empty": "When the train has passed, the ladder is empty.",
      "135-below-the-viaduct": "They step off the last rung into an empty street. Sirens."
